OL,3,GNEWSAPetitions opposing city expansion
OL,4,Ahanded to No 10
OL,5,
OL,6,FPetitions opposing plans to extend
OL,7,FLeicester's political boundary have
OL,8,Fbeen handed in to Downing Street.
OL,10,FConservative MPs collected more than
OL,11,F40,000 names of people objecting to the
OL,12,Fgovernment's plans for a major
OL,13,Fredrawing of local authority boundaries
OL,14,Fwhich would see the city extended into
OL,15,Fareas currently served by neighbouring
OL,16,Fcouncils.
OL,18,FMPs, council leaders, and campaigners
OL,19,Ftravelled to Westminster on Monday to
OL,20,Furge Prime Minister Andy Burnham to
OL,21,Fabandon the process, known as local
OL,22,Fgovernment reorganisation (LGR).
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
